# Git commit trailers

When creating commits in this repo:

1. Do **not** add `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>` or `Made-with: Cursor`.
2. End every commit message with this trailer (blank line before it):

```
Co-authored-by: Sayed Arif <87037121+arifhussain88@users.noreply.github.com>
```

3. Never commit secrets: `.env`, `.oracle_ssh_passphrase`, `.oracle_ssh_askpass.cmd`, `deploy/oracle/mafia-wars.env`, or any passphrase/API key files.

## Stop Cursor from auto-injecting its trailer

Agent tooling can append Cursor attribution even when the message above is correct. Keep this off:

- Cursor Settings → Git & PRs (or Agent) → Attribution → disable Commit Attribution and PR Attribution
- `~/.cursor/cli-config.json`: `"attribution": { "attributeCommitsToAgent": false, "attributePRsToAgent": false }`

A local `.git/hooks/commit-msg` in this repo strips `cursoragent@cursor.com` / `Made-with: Cursor` if injection still happens.
